{
  "code-input": [
    {
      "title": "문자로 받은 인증번호 넣기",
      "desc": "칸 아래에 남은 시간과 다시 받기를 둡니다. 번호가 오면 휴대폰이 첫 칸에 알아서 채우고, 칸을 다 채우면 바로 확인합니다.",
      "wide": true,
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-field u-full\" style=\"max-width: 360px\">\n  <div class=\"ds-field__header\"><span class=\"ds-field__label\" id=\"ex-otp\">인증번호</span></div>\n  <div class=\"ds-codeinput\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"ex-otp\"><input class=\"ds-codeinput__cell\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" aria-label=\"1번째 숫자\"><input class=\"ds-codeinput__cell\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" aria-label=\"2번째 숫자\"><input class=\"ds-codeinput__cell\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" aria-label=\"3번째 숫자\"><input class=\"ds-codeinput__cell\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" aria-label=\"4번째 숫자\"><input class=\"ds-codeinput__cell\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" aria-label=\"5번째 숫자\"><input class=\"ds-codeinput__cell\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" aria-label=\"6번째 숫자\"></div>\n  <div class=\"ds-field__footer u-between\"><p class=\"ds-field__help\">남은 시간 <time class=\"ds-timer\">2:48</time></p><a class=\"ds-link\" data-size=\"small\" href=\"#\">다시 받기</a></div>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "title": "번호가 틀렸을 때",
      "desc": "칸 전체를 오류 색으로 바꾸고 칸 아래에 까닭을 한 줄로 적습니다. 다시 넣을 수 있게 칸은 비우지 않습니다.",
      "wide": true,
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-field u-full\" style=\"max-width: 360px\">\n  <div class=\"ds-field__header\"><span class=\"ds-field__label\" id=\"ex-otp2\">인증번호</span></div>\n  <div class=\"ds-codeinput\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"ex-otp2\" aria-invalid=\"true\"><input class=\"ds-codeinput__cell\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" aria-label=\"1번째 숫자\" value=\"4\"><input class=\"ds-codeinput__cell\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" aria-label=\"2번째 숫자\" value=\"1\"><input class=\"ds-codeinput__cell\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" aria-label=\"3번째 숫자\" value=\"9\"><input class=\"ds-codeinput__cell\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" aria-label=\"4번째 숫자\" value=\"0\"><input class=\"ds-codeinput__cell\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" aria-label=\"5번째 숫자\" value=\"2\"><input class=\"ds-codeinput__cell\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"one-time-code\" aria-label=\"6번째 숫자\" value=\"6\"></div>\n  <div class=\"ds-field__footer\"><p class=\"ds-field__error\">번호가 맞지 않아요. 다시 확인해 주세요.</p></div>\n</div>"
    }
  ],
  "chart": [
    {
      "title": "카드 안에서 한 주 흐름 보여 주기",
      "desc": "제목과 기간을 그래프 위에 두고, 막대 아래에는 요일만 적습니다. 비교할 값이 하나면 색도 하나만 씁니다.",
      "wide": true,
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card u-full\" style=\"max-width: 420px; padding: var(--ds-space-x5)\">\n  <figure class=\"ds-chart\" data-type=\"bar\"><figcaption class=\"ds-chart__header\"><span class=\"ds-chart__title\">주간 방문</span><span class=\"ds-chart__desc\">지난 7일</span></figcaption><div class=\"ds-chart__plot\"><div class=\"ds-chart__col\"><span class=\"ds-chart__bar\" style=\"--ds-chart-value: 40%\"></span><span class=\"ds-chart__label\">월</span></div><div class=\"ds-chart__col\"><span class=\"ds-chart__bar\" style=\"--ds-chart-value: 62%\"></span><span class=\"ds-chart__label\">화</span></div><div class=\"ds-chart__col\"><span class=\"ds-chart__bar\" style=\"--ds-chart-value: 55%\"></span><span class=\"ds-chart__label\">수</span></div><div class=\"ds-chart__col\"><span class=\"ds-chart__bar\" style=\"--ds-chart-value: 80%\"></span><span class=\"ds-chart__label\">목</span></div><div class=\"ds-chart__col\"><span class=\"ds-chart__bar\" style=\"--ds-chart-value: 72%\"></span><span class=\"ds-chart__label\">금</span></div><div class=\"ds-chart__col\"><span class=\"ds-chart__bar\" style=\"--ds-chart-value: 30%\"></span><span class=\"ds-chart__label\">토</span></div><div class=\"ds-chart__col\"><span class=\"ds-chart__bar\" style=\"--ds-chart-value: 24%\"></span><span class=\"ds-chart__label\">일</span></div></div></figure>\n</article>"
    },
    {
      "title": "두 흐름을 범례와 함께 비교하기",
      "desc": "선이 둘 이상이면 아래에 범례를 둬서 색이 무엇인지 알립니다. 주된 흐름 하나에만 면을 깝니다.",
      "wide": true,
      "html": "<figure class=\"ds-chart\" data-type=\"line\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 420px\"><figcaption class=\"ds-chart__header\"><span class=\"ds-chart__title\">월별 가입</span><span class=\"ds-chart__desc\">올해</span></figcaption><div class=\"ds-chart__plot\"><svg class=\"ds-chart__svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 40\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"월별 가입\"><polygon class=\"ds-chart__area\" points=\"0,40 0,30 16.7,26 33.3,28 50,18 66.7,20 83.3,12 100,8 100,40\"/><polyline class=\"ds-chart__line\" points=\"0,30 16.7,26 33.3,28 50,18 66.7,20 83.3,12 100,8\"/><polyline class=\"ds-chart__line\" data-series=\"2\" points=\"0,34 16.7,32 33.3,30 50,29 66.7,26 83.3,24 100,22\"/></svg></div><div class=\"ds-chart__axis\"><span>1월</span><span>2월</span><span>3월</span><span>4월</span><span>5월</span><span>6월</span><span>7월</span></div><ul class=\"ds-chart__legend\"><li><span class=\"ds-chart__swatch\"></span>신규</li><li><span class=\"ds-chart__swatch\" data-series=\"2\"></span>다시 가입</li></ul></figure>"
    },
    {
      "title": "전체 안의 몫은 도넛으로",
      "desc": "가운데에 합계를 두고, 조각은 큰 것부터 차례로 놓습니다. 범례에 몫을 함께 적어 색을 구분하기 어려워도 읽게 합니다.",
      "wide": true,
      "html": "<figure class=\"ds-chart\" data-type=\"donut\"><div class=\"ds-chart__donut\" style=\"--ds-chart-1: 45; --ds-chart-2: 30; --ds-chart-3: 15; --ds-chart-4: 10\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"결제 수단 비중: 카드 45%, 계좌 이체 30%, 간편 결제 15%, 기타 10%\"><span class=\"ds-chart__total\">1,284<small>전체 주문</small></span></div><ul class=\"ds-chart__legend\"><li><span class=\"ds-chart__swatch\"></span>카드 45%</li><li><span class=\"ds-chart__swatch\" data-series=\"2\"></span>계좌 이체 30%</li><li><span class=\"ds-chart__swatch\" data-series=\"3\"></span>간편 결제 15%</li><li><span class=\"ds-chart__swatch\" data-series=\"4\"></span>기타 10%</li></ul></figure>"
    }
  ],
  "description-list": [
    {
      "title": "결제 정보는 금액을 오른쪽 끝에",
      "desc": "금액이 있는 목록은 값을 오른쪽 끝에 맞춰 위아래 숫자를 견줘 보기 쉽게 합니다. 마지막 합계만 굵게 씁니다.",
      "wide": true,
      "html": "<dl class=\"ds-desclist\" data-divider data-align=\"end\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 420px\"><div class=\"ds-desclist__item\"><dt class=\"ds-desclist__label\">상품 금액</dt><dd class=\"ds-desclist__value\">52,000원</dd></div><div class=\"ds-desclist__item\"><dt class=\"ds-desclist__label\">할인</dt><dd class=\"ds-desclist__value\">-4,000원</dd></div><div class=\"ds-desclist__item\"><dt class=\"ds-desclist__label\">배송비</dt><dd class=\"ds-desclist__value\">0원</dd></div><div class=\"ds-desclist__item\"><dt class=\"ds-desclist__label\">결제 금액</dt><dd class=\"ds-desclist__value\"><b>48,000원</b></dd></div></dl>"
    },
    {
      "title": "값이 길면 이름을 위에",
      "desc": "주소나 요청 사항처럼 긴 값은 이름을 위에 두고 넓은 화면에서는 두 칸으로 나눕니다. 좁은 화면에서는 한 칸으로 돌아갑니다.",
      "wide": true,
      "html": "<dl class=\"ds-desclist\" data-layout=\"top\" data-columns=\"2\" style=\"width: 100%\"><div class=\"ds-desclist__item\"><dt class=\"ds-desclist__label\">받는 사람</dt><dd class=\"ds-desclist__value\">와이비엠</dd></div><div class=\"ds-desclist__item\"><dt class=\"ds-desclist__label\">연락처</dt><dd class=\"ds-desclist__value\">010-1234-5678</dd></div><div class=\"ds-desclist__item\"><dt class=\"ds-desclist__label\">배송지</dt><dd class=\"ds-desclist__value\">서울시 종로구 종로 1길 23, 4층</dd></div><div class=\"ds-desclist__item\"><dt class=\"ds-desclist__label\">요청 사항</dt><dd class=\"ds-desclist__value\">문 앞에 두고 가 주세요</dd></div></dl>"
    }
  ],
  "toolbar": [
    {
      "title": "표 위 도구 막대",
      "desc": "왼쪽에 표 이름을, 오른쪽에 거르기와 내려받기, 주된 동작을 둡니다. 아래 선으로 표와 나눕니다.",
      "wide": true,
      "html": "<div class=\"u-col u-full\">\n  <div class=\"ds-toolbar\" role=\"toolbar\" aria-label=\"주문 목록 도구\" data-divider><div class=\"ds-toolbar__start\"><span class=\"ds-toolbar__title\">주문 목록</span></div><div class=\"ds-toolbar__end\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-btn\" data-variant=\"ghost\" data-size=\"small\" data-layout=\"iconOnly\" aria-label=\"거르기\"><i class=\"ds-icon ds-icon--list-filter\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-btn\" data-variant=\"ghost\" data-size=\"small\" data-layout=\"iconOnly\" aria-label=\"내려받기\"><i class=\"ds-icon ds-icon--download\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button><span class=\"ds-toolbar__separator\" role=\"separator\"></span><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-btn\" data-variant=\"neutralSolid\" data-size=\"small\"><i class=\"ds-icon ds-icon--plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>새 주문</button></div></div>\n  <table class=\"ds-table\"><thead><tr><th>주문 번호</th><th>상품</th><th data-align=\"end\">금액</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>0012</td><td>데일리 백팩 18L</td><td data-align=\"end\">42,000원</td></tr><tr><td>0011</td><td>스테인리스 텀블러</td><td data-align=\"end\">18,000원</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "title": "여러 줄을 고른 뒤 나오는 막대",
      "desc": "고른 개수와 그 줄들에 할 수 있는 동작만 담고, 바탕을 깔아 잠깐 나온 막대임을 알립니다. 끝에 선택 해제를 둡니다.",
      "wide": true,
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-toolbar u-full\" role=\"toolbar\" aria-label=\"고른 주문 도구\" data-variant=\"muted\" data-size=\"small\"><div class=\"ds-toolbar__start\"><span class=\"ds-toolbar__count\">3개 선택</span></div><div class=\"ds-toolbar__end\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-btn\" data-variant=\"neutralWeak\" data-size=\"small\">내보내기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-btn\" data-variant=\"neutralWeak\" data-size=\"small\">삭제</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-btn\" data-variant=\"ghost\" data-size=\"small\" data-layout=\"iconOnly\" aria-label=\"선택 해제\"><i class=\"ds-icon ds-icon--x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button></div></div>"
    }
  ],
  "tree": [
    {
      "title": "파일 탐색기",
      "desc": "폴더와 파일을 아이콘으로 나누고, 지금 연 파일을 고른 줄로 보여 줍니다. 펼칠 것이 없는 줄도 펼침 자리를 비워 둬 이름이 한 줄로 맞습니다.",
      "wide": true,
      "html": "<ul class=\"ds-tree\" role=\"tree\" aria-label=\"강의 자료 폴더\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 320px\"><li class=\"ds-tree__node\" role=\"treeitem\" aria-expanded=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"ds-tree__row\"><span class=\"ds-tree__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><i class=\"ds-icon ds-icon--folder-open ds-tree__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span class=\"ds-tree__label\">강의 자료</span></div><ul class=\"ds-tree__group\" role=\"group\"><li class=\"ds-tree__node\" role=\"treeitem\" aria-expanded=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"ds-tree__row\"><span class=\"ds-tree__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><i class=\"ds-icon ds-icon--folder-open ds-tree__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span class=\"ds-tree__label\">1주차</span></div><ul class=\"ds-tree__group\" role=\"group\"><li class=\"ds-tree__node\" role=\"treeitem\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"ds-tree__row\"><span class=\"ds-tree__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><i class=\"ds-icon ds-icon--file-text ds-tree__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span class=\"ds-tree__label\">강의 계획서.docx</span></div></li><li class=\"ds-tree__node\" role=\"treeitem\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"ds-tree__row\"><span class=\"ds-tree__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><i class=\"ds-icon ds-icon--file ds-tree__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span class=\"ds-tree__label\">발표 자료.pdf</span></div></li></ul></li><li class=\"ds-tree__node\" role=\"treeitem\" aria-expanded=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"ds-tree__row\"><span class=\"ds-tree__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><i class=\"ds-icon ds-icon--folder ds-tree__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span class=\"ds-tree__label\">2주차</span></div><ul class=\"ds-tree__group\" role=\"group\"><li class=\"ds-tree__node\" role=\"treeitem\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"ds-tree__row\"><span class=\"ds-tree__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><i class=\"ds-icon ds-icon--file ds-tree__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span class=\"ds-tree__label\">읽을거리.pdf</span></div></li></ul></li></ul></li><li class=\"ds-tree__node\" role=\"treeitem\" aria-expanded=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"ds-tree__row\"><span class=\"ds-tree__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><i class=\"ds-icon ds-icon--folder ds-tree__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span class=\"ds-tree__label\">과제</span><span class=\"ds-tree__suffix\">3</span></div><ul class=\"ds-tree__group\" role=\"group\"><li class=\"ds-tree__node\" role=\"treeitem\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"ds-tree__row\"><span class=\"ds-tree__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><i class=\"ds-icon ds-icon--file-text ds-tree__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span class=\"ds-tree__label\">과제 1.docx</span></div></li></ul></li><li class=\"ds-tree__node\" role=\"treeitem\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"ds-tree__row\"><span class=\"ds-tree__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><i class=\"ds-icon ds-icon--file-text ds-tree__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><span class=\"ds-tree__label\">공지.txt</span></div></li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "title": "분류를 고르는 좁은 메뉴",
      "desc": "이음선 없이 들여쓰기만 두고 줄 높이를 줄여 좁은 칸에 넣습니다. 분류 옆 숫자로 들어 있는 개수를 알립니다.",
      "wide": true,
      "html": "<ul class=\"ds-tree\" role=\"tree\" aria-label=\"상품 분류\" data-size=\"small\" data-guides=\"none\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 240px\"><li class=\"ds-tree__node\" role=\"treeitem\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"ds-tree__row\"><span class=\"ds-tree__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"ds-tree__label\">전체</span><span class=\"ds-tree__suffix\">128</span></div></li><li class=\"ds-tree__node\" role=\"treeitem\" aria-expanded=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"ds-tree__row\"><span class=\"ds-tree__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"ds-tree__label\">패션</span><span class=\"ds-tree__suffix\">64</span></div><ul class=\"ds-tree__group\" role=\"group\"><li class=\"ds-tree__node\" role=\"treeitem\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"ds-tree__row\"><span class=\"ds-tree__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"ds-tree__label\">가방</span><span class=\"ds-tree__suffix\">22</span></div></li><li class=\"ds-tree__node\" role=\"treeitem\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"ds-tree__row\"><span class=\"ds-tree__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"ds-tree__label\">신발</span><span class=\"ds-tree__suffix\">42</span></div></li></ul></li><li class=\"ds-tree__node\" role=\"treeitem\" aria-expanded=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"ds-tree__row\"><span class=\"ds-tree__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"ds-tree__label\">생활</span><span class=\"ds-tree__suffix\">40</span></div><ul class=\"ds-tree__group\" role=\"group\"><li class=\"ds-tree__node\" role=\"treeitem\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"ds-tree__row\"><span class=\"ds-tree__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"ds-tree__label\">주방</span><span class=\"ds-tree__suffix\">25</span></div></li></ul></li><li class=\"ds-tree__node\" role=\"treeitem\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"ds-tree__row\"><span class=\"ds-tree__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"ds-tree__label\">도서</span><span class=\"ds-tree__suffix\">24</span></div></li></ul>"
    }
  ],
  "wheel-picker": [
    {
      "title": "바텀 시트 안에서 생년월일 고르기",
      "desc": "모바일에서는 칸을 눌러 바텀 시트를 열고 그 안에서 돌려 고릅니다. 다 고르면 아래 버튼으로 닫습니다.",
      "wide": true,
